OL,11,     Fone pair of guests.
OL,12,G1925 Four in a Bed
OL,13,     FPro chef Stephen hosts the week's
OL,14,     Fthird visit at The Crossings Inn
OL,15,     Fin Cumbria. His ethos is
OL,16,     Fno-nonsense accommodation and
OL,17,     Fgorgeous grub, so eggs-pectations
OL,18,     Fare sky high at breakfast time.
